        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion T4, Panic-Proof Quincy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Quincy Entranceset with Interconnect has a traditional oval shape. A two-piece handleset, it allows for variable center to center installation. The Panic-Proof Quincy Handleset has an emergency egress option so that your front door can be opened when locked by simply turning the inside lever or knob. It has an adjustable latch for doors 2-3/8 inch backsets or 2-3/4 inch backsets and will fit doors 1-3/4 inches to 2 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Interconnected Single Cylinder Handleset</b> allows you to simply turn your interior lever or knob to open your door without having to unlock the deadbolt. This handleset is also available as a Dummy which means that it is a non-functional handleset made as a rigid pull for doors that don't need to be locked or latched.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Oval Quincy Handleset Fusion T4:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion T4 Traditional Quincy Front Door Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Outside Length: 16-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: adjustable for 2-3/8\"or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</B>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Quincy Entranceset with Interconnect, Fusion T4",
                "description": "Fusion T4, Quincy Entranceset with Interconnect - The Quincy Entranceset with Interconnect has a traditional oval shape. A two-piece handleset, it allows for variable center to center installation. The Panic-Proof Quincy Handleset has an emergency egress option so that your front door can be opened when locked by simply turning the inside lever or knob. It has an adjustable latch for doors 2-3/8 inch backsets or 2-3/4 inch backsets and will fit doors 1-3/4 inches to 2 inches thick.",
